# Files whose bytes have to be the same on every machine.
#
# `apps/dashboard/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt` is generated and then compared against
# the committed copy by `bun run notices --check` in CI. Without an explicit
# setting, a checkout on Windows materialises it with CRLF while the generator
# writes LF, so the check fails locally for a file nobody touched. The generator
# normalises its inputs to LF; this keeps the working tree agreeing with it.
#
# The vendored font licences are upstream text kept verbatim, and nothing should
# rewrite them in passing.
apps/dashboard/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt text eol=lf
apps/dashboard/licenses/*.txt text eol=lf
